      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The missing cost is often not the management fee alone. It is everything around it: Airbnb fees, direct payment costs, discounting, and day-to-day execution. Seascape's current benchmark shows an observed 13.4% Airbnb host-fee cost compared with an approximate 2.9% direct payment cost."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can direct bookings improve what an owner keeps?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes, when they replace higher-cost marketplace bookings. Seascape's current Gulf Coast operating set has already routed $119,923 through direct bookings, but the benchmark treats that upside as an example rather than a universal guarantee."
      }
    },
